A note on one dependency, because it is not open source.

`@anthropic-ai/claude-agent-sdk` is published under Anthropic's own terms
("© Anthropic PBC. All rights reserved", see
https://code.claude.com/docs/en/legal-and-compliance) and is **not** covered by
this project's licence. It is a build-time dependency of the optional
`claude-agent-sdk` runtime adapter.

It is deliberately absent from everything this project distributes. The bundles
carried by `dist/install-agbrte.sh` — the CLI, the session host, and the agent
host — contain no Anthropic code, and a test enforces that so it cannot start
shipping by accident. Anyone wanting that adapter installs the SDK themselves and
accepts Anthropic's terms directly, which is the only arrangement this project's
licence could honestly describe.

Everything else in the dependency tree is MIT, ISC, BSD, 0BSD, or public domain.
